#
# Example shape for the English system lexicon resource. This file is
# committed only to document the TSV format and as a smoke-test input; it is
# NOT installed to ${FCITX_INSTALL_PKGDATADIR}. Production resources are
# generated by tools/prepare_english_lexicon.sh and pinned by SHA-256 in
# data-licenses/english/manifest.json.
#
# Fields: key <TAB> tier <TAB> display <TAB> flags
#   tier ∈ 0..9 coarse frequency bucket (source-local, not cross-source)
#   flags: {p=proper, t=technical, l=literal-only}, comma-separated, may be empty
#
# All words below are common English dictionary surface forms; each row's
# tier is hand-authored by the project's contributors and is NOT derived
# from a specific external corpus.

